    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Dec 27, 2010 at 2:38 AM, SNV Krishna <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kri...@primps.com.sg</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\n\n\n\n<div>\n<div><span><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">Dear \nAll,</font></span></div>\n<div><span><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"></font></span> </div>\n<div><span><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">Is it possible to \nhave multiple lines on leftside y-axis and right side y-axis in ggplot2. I \nassume there is a way but do not know how to accomplish it. For ex. the data set \nlooks like this</font></span></div>\n<div><span><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"></font></span> </div>\n<div>\n<table style=\"width:144pt;border-collapse:collapse\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"192\">\n  <colgroup>\n  <col style=\"width:48pt\" span=\"3\" width=\"64\">\n  </colgroup><tbody>\n  <tr style=\"min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\">\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;width:48pt;min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\" width=\"64\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">year</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;width:48pt\" width=\"64\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">variable</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;width:48pt\" width=\"64\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">value</font></td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\">\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">2007</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">x1</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">10</font></td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\">\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">2008</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">x1</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">11</font></td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\">\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">2009</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">x1</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">13</font></td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\">\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">2007</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">x2</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">18</font></td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\">\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">2008</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">x2</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">19</font></td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\">\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">2009</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">x2</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">21</font></td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\">\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">2007</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">y1</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">123</font></td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\">\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">2008</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">y1</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">124</font></td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\">\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent;min-height:12.75pt\" height=\"17\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">2009</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">y1</font></td>\n    <td style=\"border:medium none rgb(236,233,216);background-color:transparent\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">130</font></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"></font> </div>\n<div><span><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">I would like to get \na <b>line</b> plot of x1 and x2 against year on left hand side \ny-axis and y1 on right hand side y-axis. any help or ideas will be greatly \nappreciated.</font></span></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div><br>The approach to which Brandon alluded is sensible; i.e., a conditioning plot by variable with free ranging y-scales. Something like (untested, and assuming your data frame is named df)<br>\n<br>ggplot(df, aes(x = year, y = value)) + geom_line(aes(group = variable)) + facet_grid(. ~ variable, scales = &#39;free_y&#39;)<br><br>[Replace group with color or linetype if you want to identify the individual series in a legend.] If you want the first two in the same panel, you could do something like<br>\n<br>df$var &lt;- factor(substr(as.character(df$variable), 1, 1))     # should end up with x and y as levels <br></div>ggplot(df, aes(x = year, y = value)) + geom_line(aes(group = variable)) + <br>       facet_grid(var ~ ., scales = &#39;free_y&#39;)<br>\n<br>To get the y plot on top, which would make more sense to me, reverse the levels in df$var:<br>df$var &lt;- factor(substr(as.character(df$variable), 1, 1), levels = c(&#39;y&#39;, &#39;x&#39;))<br><br>and repeat the above ggplot() + ... line.<br>\n<br>There are graphics tricks you can pull if you want (some of them are in the plotrix package and used in conjunction with base graphics), but since I don&#39;t endorse any of them, you&#39;re on your own if you want to go in that direction.<br>\n<br>HTH,<br>Dennis<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div><div> </div>\n<div><span><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">thanks in advance \nand regards,</font></span></div>\n<div><span><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"></font></span><span></span><span><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"></font></span> </div>\n<div><span><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\">SNVK \n</font></span></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"></font> </div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
